:::
:::


#### **Recent period: 2001--2025**

During 2001–2025, earlier phenology remained evident across portions of the West and central United States, while later events occurred in portions of the northern and eastern interior (@fig-oab-emergence-recent, @fig-oab-egg-hatch-recent). Significant changes were less spatially extensive than over the full period.


