### **ii. Climatic suitability**

#### **Entire period: 1981--2025**

Predicted cold stress decreased across broad portions of the northern United States over 1981–2025, while heat stress increased across the Southwest and southern Great Plains (@fig-oab-cold-stress, @fig-oab-heat-stress). Significant increases in climatic suitability were concentrated in portions of the northern United States, including areas around the Great Lakes and northern Plains (@fig-oab-suitability).


